From 6a2e00f69fe0bbe7a4131ba7ff7d7c40fac898cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gitman-101111 <development@spamfolder.xyz>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:23:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] power: add the Maxim MAX77818 charger and fuel gauge

MFD core, charger (with the thermal cooling device the battery thermal
zone drives), fuel gauge (max17042-family registers plus the MAX77818
additions) and safeout regulators, ported from reMarkable's linux-imx-rm
6.12 tree. The charger exposes its operating mode (charger / OTG supply
/ off) as a power-supply property so the Type-C controller can flip it;
add that property and the fuel gauge's high-resolution capacity to the
power-supply core.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/mfd/Kconfig                       |   11 +
 drivers/mfd/Makefile                      |    1 +
 drivers/mfd/max77818.c                    |  273 ++++
 drivers/power/supply/Kconfig              |   16 +
 drivers/power/supply/Makefile             |    2 +
 drivers/power/supply/max77818-charger.c   | 1202 +++++++++++++++
